+// [diag] Report the GL/EGL backend actually in use at RS startup.
+//
+// The hidumper "-a gles" dump path needs the DUMP permission and is therefore
+// unavailable on some builds (see DumpManagerService::HasDumpPermission).
+// Without it there is no way to tell hardware acceleration from the software
+// rasterizer (swrast/llvmpipe), which is the first thing to check when the
